  "lyrics":[
    {
      "section_id":"section_0",
      "type":"intro",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"See if I can do without reading",
          "rhyme":"iN",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"A",
      "rhyme_vowel":"A"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Lovin' is what I can give to you",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"So tell me you love me, 'cause I know you do",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Every night you go to sleep, tell me, am I on your mind?",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"We could be sleepin' in the streets, but if I'm with you, it feel so fine",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"In the morning, you'll be gone, then it all goes away",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Tell me that you gotta leave, but I know you wanna stay",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Deep within your conscience, the place that I reside",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Runnin' out of options, baby, you be wastin' all my time",
          "rhyme":"ajm",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"It gets a little crowded, all things runnin' through my mind",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Maybe I'll be able to tell you one day, hopefully soon",
          "rhyme":"un",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Last night we were high, floatin' over the moon",
          "rhyme":"un",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Smokin' wit' you, I'm smokin' wit' you",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Life is what you make it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Wear my heart out on my sleeve, baby, you my favorite",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Sorry if I'm starin', your body just so sacred",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Come with me, runnin' free, now we gettin' faded",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDEFGHCIIAJJEE",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABCDEFDGCAAADDEE"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_2",
      "type":"chorus",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"I hope my suspicions ain't been right all along",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"You are all I've known for so long",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"We both agree, we don't know what's goin' on",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Gone, gone, gone, gone",
          "rhyme":"on",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"You my fantasy gone wrong",
          "rhyme":"$g",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AAABC",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AAABA"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_3",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"If love is the feelin' that got you afraid",
          "rhyme":"Ed",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Then maybe it's time you start walkin' away",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Your beauty like somethin' I saw in a painting, amazing",
          "rhyme":"iN",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"The world never seen somethin' like you",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Every mornin' that I wake up, wish you were layin' next to me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Tell me what you made of, girl, say what you believe",
          "rhyme":"iv",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Sleepin' with somebody else, tell me what I'm missin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"I see it all in your face, you such a politician",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"And these days, we ain't",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Talkin' as much as we used to",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"You miss me, but shit keeps",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Spirallin' out of control",
          "rhyme":"ol",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"And we changed into",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Two different people, I noticed",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"I miss you, continue",
          "rhyme":"y",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"To slowly lose you, I know",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Larry_Lovestein"
        }
      ],
